    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ROBERT LOWRY PROPERTIES presents this GORGEOUS, 2 BED, CORNER, FIRST FLOOR APARTMENT with Parking, B Rated BER, Newly Painted throughout, New Laminate Wooden Flooring and a Large, Bright, South-West Facing Living/Kitchen/Dining Room & Corner Balcony. Built in 2002 and measuring circa 60 Sq. Metres, 24 Melville Park is located beside Meakstown SC & Charlestown SC, Dublin Bus Services and close to Finglas Village & M50/M2 Motorways. Accommodation consists of L Shaped Halway, Living/Kitchen/Dining Room with Fully Fitted Kitchen & Corner South-West Facing Balcony, 2 Double Bedrooms with Built in Wardrobes and Bathroom with Bath & Power Shower. The property is also being sold with vacant possession and is chain free. Ideal for first time buyers, please contact Robert Lowry @ 086-0236685 or by email through the advert.\n\n***Management Fees are presently 1,466 in 2026.\n***The property is rent capped: Rent was 1352 per month in early 2026 and was last reviewed in November 2023.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\nL Shaped Hallway: 3.7m x 2.1m\nWith New Lamimate Wooden Flooring & Hotpress.\n\nLiving/Kitchen/Dining Room: 6.7m x 3.5m\nWith New Lamimate Wooden Flooring, Fully Fitted Kitchen & Double Doors to South-West Facing Corner Balcony.\n\nBedroom 1: 5.3m x 2.75m\nWith New Lamimate Wooden Flooring and Built in Wardobes.\n\nBedroom 2: 4.4m x 2.6m\nWith New Lamimate Wooden Flooring and Built in Wardobes.\n\nBathroom: 2m x 1.8m\nWith New Lino Flooring, Wc, Whb, Bath & Power Shower.\n\nFEATURES:\nGorgeous 2 Double Bed, 1 Bath, 1st Floor Corner Apartment measuring circa 60 Sq. Metres & Built in 2002.\nOne Dedicated parking space and visitor parking available.\nBER Energy Rating: B.\nNew Laminate Wooden Flooring & Newly Painted throughout.\nLarge, Bright, South-West Facing Living/Kitchen/Dining Room & Corner Balcony.\nFully Fitted Kitchen.\nBuilt in Wardrobes in both Bedrooms.\nBathroom with Bath & Power Shower.\nExcellent Location beside Meakstown SC, Charlestown SC, Dublin Bus Services and close to Finglas Village & M50/M2 Motorways.\nVacant Possession and Chain Free."
      },
